OL,3,ATrump says AI safety fears a 'hoax' as
OL,4,Ahe rejects calls for greater safeguards
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has said
OL,7,Ffears about the safety of AI are a
OL,8,F"hoax", as he criticised calls to have
OL,9,Fmore guardrails for the fast-moving
OL,10,Ftechnology.
OL,12,FIt comes after Jack Clark, a co-founder
OL,13,Fof AI giant Anthropic, told the BBC
OL,14,Fthat a "kill switch" for dangerous AI
OL,15,Fthat can be checked by a third party
OL,16,Fmay need to be mandatory for the
OL,17,Findustry.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11904
SC,0004
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1789444460
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,ATrump says AI safety fears a 'hoax' as
OL,4,Ahe rejects calls for greater safeguards
OL,5,
OL,6,FClark's comments followed warnings
OL,7,Fabout the risks the technology poses to
OL,8,Fhumanity that have been raised in
OL,9,Frecent days by several executives and
OL,10,Fstaff at leading AI firms.
OL,12,FThose concerns triggered a selloff in
OL,13,Fshares of some tech firms on Monday as
OL,14,Finvestors weighed the impact of a
OL,15,Fpotential slowdown in the development
OL,16,Fof AI.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/18
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
