OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1789444460
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,APubs in England and Wales to allow
OL,4,Adigital ID apps to prove age
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe change means businesses will no
OL,7,Flonger be required to let people use
OL,8,Fphysical ID, but the government
OL,9,Fcontends most establishments would.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/18
